# Custodian local-development environment.
# Every value below is a LOCAL-ONLY secret baked in for convenience: nothing here is
# reachable from outside this machine (all host ports bind to 127.0.0.1).
# Regenerate any of them with the one-liners in "SECRETS GEN GUIDE.md".
# Copy to .env (gitignored) and fill in the two provider keys.

# ---- The only two values you must supply ----
